  <ym-title|Trace rate conversion and local scale
  selection><label|trace-rate-conversion-and-local-scale-selection>

  <\itemize-minus>
    <item>Unit: YM-000026, selected-scale trace producer.

    <item>Status: draft; finite rate summation and the local support-cost
    selection are proved from the displayed quantities and source algebra.
    Entry receipts remain open.

    <item>Imported Lean revision: <verbatim|3456e5e75cf8d4cd558955a5c7638fba2d68f464>.

    <item>Manuscript: <verbatim|manuscript/existence/trace-local-rate-selection.tex>.
  </itemize-minus>

